<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Get oCreature's Attribute/Property value in an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> form.
See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetCreatureProperty" title="GetCreatureProperty">GetCreatureProperty</a> for more details.
</p>
